{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>【Now新聞台】在北京，外交部回應美國中期選舉結果，稱願意繼續同美方維護好兩國元首重要共識。</p></div>\n<div class=\"contentTxt\"><p>外交部發言人毛寧：「中期選舉是美國內政，中方願繼續同美方一道維護好、落實好兩國元首重要共識，加強溝通、妥處分歧、拓展合作，構建基於尊重、公平、對等的中美建設性戰略穩定關係。」</p></div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:25:33.049015+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T08:09:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:43.133519+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:43.133519+00:00","content_hash":"e4e255f04151c8c8969b5718665a5c5e459b0f5289f87189232155c35a2da110","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}